<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-MIM half-year op loss A$0.4 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-MIM half-year op loss A$0.4 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended Dec 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating loss			  0.4 vs profit 45.3</p>
<p>    Net loss				 12.0 vs profit 58.9</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		     1.25 vs 2.5</p>
<p>NOTE: MIM Holdings Ltd is a base and precious</p>
<p>metals miner and smelting group.</p>
<p>    Sales (billion)			  1.10 vs 1.30</p>
<p>    Other income			     20.5 vs 41.7</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			 loss 0.74 vs profit 3.71</p>
<p>    Abnormal items  loss		  198.9 vs profit 43.4</p>
<p>Dividend is nil percent franked</p>
<p>Pay date March 24</p>
<p>Reg date Feb 28</p>
<p>    Tax				credit 187.4 vs charge 29.4</p>
<p>    Interest				   23.6 vs  34.5</p>
<p>    Depreciation			    106.1 vs 113.6</p>
<p>    Minorities				  0.1 vs 0.4</p>
<p>NOTE: MIM said abnormal losses mainly reflected write down in the value of Mount Isa Mines and restructuring charges.</p>
<p>Profit before tax, interest, abnormals and exchange gains or losses for industry segment.</p>
<p>    Metals				 loss 8.4 vs profit 89.7</p>
<p>    Coal				 profit 4.4 vs loss 15.3</p>
<p>    Gold					  0.3 vs 4.8</p>
<p>    Other					40.6 vs 9.5</p>
<p>    Investments				 0.1 vs 7.6</p>
<p>NOTE: profit before tax, interest, abnormals and exchange gains or losses for geographic segment</p>
</text>
